<title>USA: Capsure Holdings Corp Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>Capsure Holdings Corp Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			  3,813		    5,520</p>
<p> Revs			25,509		   28,906</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,584		   15,906</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 operating earnings from continuing operating segments $0.23 vs $0.17.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 net income includes $0.02 a share net investment income and $0.16 a share in United Capitol operating earnings. United Capitol Holding Co and its subsidiaries were sold on May 22, 1996.</p>
